%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 79c1856cac5ce614280ef9d32b707814, type: 3}
  m_Name: Reginald_recipe
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::TeaRecipe
  introText: "Good afternoon! I do hope your tea is brewed properly. A good cup deserves
    patience\u2026 and unfortunately, patience seems rather uncommon these days."
  questionSets:
  - exchanges:
    - playerQuestion: You seem to know your tea.
      npcResponse: "I should hope so. Tea isn\u2019t something to be hurried. People
        nowadays treat it as though it were merely another drink. Such urgency ruins
        the experience! "
      keyword: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 7272cd0d790f57b4fa9221fa86eccd5b, type: 2}
    - playerQuestion: You sound very particular about it.
      npcResponse: "Oh, not particular\u2026 simply respectful. One shouldn't make
        rash decisions, especially when preparing a proper cup."
      keyword: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e88bce65fae3e944fa73551f7e0079f5, type: 2}
    - playerQuestion: "Does the way it\u2019s made matter so much to you?"
      npcResponse: Very much so. If one begins rushing the little things, it becomes
        terribly easy to rush the important ones as well. Urgency should be kept
        for the things that actually deserve it.
      keyword: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 7272cd0d790f57b4fa9221fa86eccd5b, type: 2}
  - exchanges:
    - playerQuestion: Do you always order the same thing?
      npcResponse: Without fail. Some traditions are worth keeping, even if the world
        insists on changing around them.
      keyword: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5a82941f92e60c5459f1a5f3f66fb894, type: 2}
    - playerQuestion: Been drinking tea for years every day?
      npcResponse: Without fail. Some traditions are worth keeping, even if the world
        insists on changing around them.
      keyword: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 43f0729bfbf155a4381598314ca041ff, type: 2}
    - playerQuestion: Most people try something new.
      npcResponse: "Oh, novelty has its place. But I find a certain comfort in familiar
        habits.\t"
      keyword: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a0bb02920dbb04046aa8073baa71257b, type: 2}
  - exchanges:
    - playerQuestion: 'Those rituals seem important to you. '
      npcResponse: They are. Every cup reminds me of another time. I find myself
        reminiscing more often than I used to.
      keyword: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a3f9f1466b79c554f9c5bdcea89ab291, type: 2}
    - playerQuestion: Did someone teach you all your tea knowledge?
      npcResponse: "My wife had impeccable taste. I suppose I\u2019ve grown rather
        attached to the way we used to share our afternoon tea and the way she spoke
        about the tea."
      keyword: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bb60e62d8789c5b4f9f3134a46927582, type: 2}
    - playerQuestion: You speak about tea fondly.
      npcResponse: "I do. Some memories refuse to fade, and I wouldn't wish them
        to. They are fond memories and I\u2019m quite attached to them."
      keyword: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bb60e62d8789c5b4f9f3134a46927582, type: 2}
  - exchanges:
    - playerQuestion: Do you still enjoy your days?
      npcResponse: "I try to. Though if I\u2019m being honest, life has felt rather
        stuck since she\u2019s not in the picture anymore."
      keyword: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 54692ec9cafe8c5489ef5478c3a77dc9, type: 2}
    - playerQuestion: I imagine mine is not the only tea shop you tried. What brings
        you to tea shops so often?
      npcResponse: "It\u2019s not. I suppose I\u2019m still searching for what comes
        next. Since the tea shop we used to be regulars at closed, I've been uncertain
        about where to go."
      keyword: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d8b10c2e29caab1489c0c5f1bf463256, type: 2}
    - playerQuestion: Do you ever think about changing your routine?
      npcResponse: "I\u2019ve considered it. Yet without her, I sometimes struggle
        to find any real direction. Plus, changing the tea shops I try in hopes of
        finding a good one  is enough change."
      keyword: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bca85ebb852d8394a8ef9d2af61e73f4, type: 2}
  - exchanges:
    - playerQuestion: Do people understand why this matters to you?
      npcResponse: "Not always. Though I admit it\u2019s nice when someone understands
        why these little things matter. That kind of validation means more than people
        realize."
      keyword: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2be31dc8bd769d9428c706cf79ccb25c, type: 2}
    - playerQuestion: Does it matter when someone remembers your order?
      npcResponse: It does. It reminds me that some things are still worth remembering.
        A little reassurance goes a surprisingly long way.
      keyword: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e7a499c46dee9694fb2427ccc5ec9a5f, type: 2}
    - playerQuestion: What do you think makes a teahouse special?
      npcResponse: The people, more than the tea. A kind word or a bit of encouragement
        can brighten an otherwise quiet afternoon.
      keyword: {fileID: 11400000, guid: ae962c1c8c6b0e14bb4c0dabbe47355d, type: 2}
  - exchanges:
    - playerQuestion: You must miss those afternoons together.
      npcResponse: "I do\u2026 more than I usually admit. It\u2019s rather a vulnerable
        thing to say aloud."
      keyword: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 1a31f6714614eec4ca8f961471f676e4, type: 2}
    - playerQuestion: "I hope you\u2019ll be coming back here."
      npcResponse: "I think I will. This place does indeed bring comfort and good
        company reminds me that I don\u2019t have to carry every memory alone."
      keyword: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 625f5205aabc3a742905577e444f9820, type: 2}
    - playerQuestion: What does the perfect cup of tea mean to you?
      npcResponse: "It reminds me that love can linger in the smallest rituals. And
        somehow\u2026 that feels like support, even now."
      keyword: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c32166d6b01f77143b7170c8b84b28e7, type: 2}
  requiredIngredients: []
